    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναθολ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make turbid,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾠά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					753a30
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναθολοῦται τὸ ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>HA</u>
					592a8
				</span></i>
